sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor B as Buyer
  participant A as App (Listing page)
  participant W as Billing worker
  participant F as Firestore
  participant N as NOWPayments
  B->>A: Buy
  A->>W: POST /checkout {kind: order, listingId}
  W->>F: Read listing and the seller's page
  W->>W: Checks: active, price 1 to 500, not own page, not bought yet
  W->>F: One commit: order (pending, fee fixed) + payment (pending)
  W->>N: Create hosted invoice
  W-->>A: {checkoutUrl}
  B->>N: Pays in crypto
  N->>W: Signed webhook: finished
  W->>F: Read order, page content, listing, buyer, seller
  alt seller's page still exists
    W->>F: One commit: buyer gets a private copy (project + content, projectCount + 1)
    W->>F: Seller earnings + sale minus fee, ledger "sale", listing salesCount + 1
    W->>F: Order = delivered, payment = paid
  else seller's page is gone
    W->>F: Order = paid, needsReview, nothing delivered
  end
  B->>A: Back on /market/orders: sees "Delivered" and a link to the copy
